                    </li>
                    
                        <li class="medguide">Medication Guide: <a href="/dailymed/medguide.cfm?setid=57583c1d-9c44-4503-917d-68dba7377bd1"  target="_blank">HTML</a></li>
                    

                    <li class="print">
                        <a href="/dailymed/fda/fdaDrugXsl.cfm?setid=57583c1d-9c44-4503-917d-68dba7377bd1&type=display"
